msgid "Preserve MainWP Connection"
msgstr "保留 MainWP 连接"

msgid "Preserves MainWP Child connection details from being overwritten during WP Migrate (formerly WP Migrate DB Pro) push/pull operations and database imports."
msgstr "在 WP Migrate（原 WP Migrate DB Pro）推送/拉取操作和数据库导入期间，防止 MainWP Child 连接详细信息被覆盖。"

